{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_17208490","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17208490","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"subtitle:2:1720848001:":{"text":"발렌은 꽃다발과 랜덤 박스를 들고","source_cn":"捧着花和宝盒，维伦切入舞圈","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15AA372B56D3DFDF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"subtitle:2:1720848002:":{"text":"춤을 추고 있는 샬로티에게 다가갔다.","source_cn":"径直走向舞蹈着的夏洛蒂","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49E91ADF1526B3E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"subtitle:2:1720848003:":{"text":"아무도 발렌을 막을 생각은 하지 못한 채","source_cn":"所有人都忘记了阻止他的动作","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45FC8557D6B60C4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"subtitle:2:1720848004:":{"text":"오히려 무의식적으로 길을 비켜 주었다.","source_cn":"甚至不由自主地为他让开了路","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3C1F700FC774177","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1720848005:":{"text":"잠깐, 당신은...","source_cn":"等一下，你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB327A19407A7723B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1720848006:":{"text":"발렌?","source_cn":"维伦？<key:dialog3>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC471C5AE0A837465","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1720848007:":{"text":"한 곡, 괜찮으실까요?","source_cn":"能否请你跳一支舞？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2165005F507B0E14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1720848008:":{"text":"...물론이죠.","source_cn":"……当然","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7890A1DD6E096020","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1720849001:0":{"text":"발렌, 정말 올 줄은 몰랐는데요.","source_cn":"维伦，我从没想过你真的会来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E06DDB01F9825F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1720849002:0":{"text":"초대장을 건넸을 때 얼버무렸잖아요. 그래서 안 올 줄 알았어요.","source_cn":"我递给你邀请函时，你毫不犹豫地模糊过去了。我以为你不会来的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EADD54953041211","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1720849003:1":{"text":"제 말은... 기뻐요. 와 줘서 고마워요.","source_cn":"我的意思是……我很开心。谢谢你能过来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96C01410B5001BCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1720849004:0":{"text":"선물은 마음에 드시나요?","source_cn":"礼物还喜欢吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x894F4CC6F8F9BDCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1720849005:0":{"text":"아드리온이 들고 있는 저거죠? 아마 연회가 끝난 뒤에나 제대로 열어볼 수 있겠네요.","source_cn":"你是指亚德里恩的手里那份？我恐怕要在舞会后才能仔细拆开看了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD361538B1BD2EDCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1720849006:0":{"text":"하지만 괜찮아요. 당신이 와준 것 자체가 선물이니까요.","source_cn":"这都无所谓。你来了，就是最好的礼物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F7DD6532A828CC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1720849007:0":{"text":"왜 온 거죠?","source_cn":"你为什么会来？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94D6FD1B0B293933","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1720849008:0":{"text":"그냥요. 예전에 무도회에서 춤을 추기로 약속했었던 게 생각나서요.","source_cn":"我只是忽然想起，过去的确和你有过约定，要在一次舞会上共舞。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B6962ABA133AB11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1720849009:0":{"text":"기억하고 있군요.","source_cn":"你还记得。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68A880ECE782B20F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1720849010:0":{"text":"인생의 새로운 단계로 나아가지만, 과거에 미련을 남겨둔 채라면 제아무리 멋진 새 삶이라도 어딘가 빛이 바랠 겁니다.","source_cn":"虽说即将迈入人生的新阶段，但若是在过去留下遗憾，难免也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FA644FAA00DC821","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1720849011:0":{"text":"과거는 이미 지나갔어요. 저희 모두 앞으로 나아가야 하죠.","source_cn":"过去的事都已经过去了，我们都要继续往前走。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04749EE9CF91A924","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1720849012:0":{"text":"오늘 이 춤은, 과거와 완전히 작별하기 위한 거라고 생각해 줘요.","source_cn":"今天这支舞，请将它当做对过去彻底的告别吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE140E5FA6A29D13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1720849013:0":{"text":"샬로티 양, 당신의 미래가 과거의 그림자에 얽매이지 않고, 자유롭게 이어지기를 바랍니다.","source_cn":"夏洛蒂小姐，愿您的未来，能够不必沾染过去的影子，不受约...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21FD5ECBB4BACA55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1720849014:0":{"text":"진정으로 하고 싶은 일을 하면서, 진정 함께하고 싶은 사람과 함께하면서... 원하는 삶을 사세요.","source_cn":"去做您想做的事，与您真正想要相伴一生的人在一起，过您真...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE63E0FD8E93CFE8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1720849015:1":{"text":"그게 당신의 바람인가요, 발렌?","source_cn":"这也是你的愿望吗，维伦？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91E314D5F1875782","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1720849016:0":{"text":"...흥, 하지만 제가 바라는 건 아니네요.","source_cn":"……哼，但这可不是我的愿望哦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD0E7AC6A9A7588D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1720849017:0":{"text":"...샬로티 양?","source_cn":"呃……夏洛蒂小姐？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58D34FF987527BEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1720849018:0":{"text":"여기까지 왔으면 결판을 내야죠. 같이 도망칠래요? 저희 둘만.","source_cn":"既然你来了，那就别想走。我们私奔怎么样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67F43F5BF8975F71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1720849019:0":{"text":"샬로티 양, 저는...","source_cn":"夏洛蒂小姐，我——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCF5BD53CBEADC22","var